### Test de notifications pour citoyen qui signale un bac

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlNDg3YjVjYy0xZGY0LTQ2NTAtYTFmNy1hNzk5ODU5YmUyMjEiLCJlbWFpbCI6Imxvb25hNzc1N0BnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJwaG9uZSI6IisyMjc2OTg3NjU0MzIiLCJyb2xlIjoiQURNSU4iLCJpYXQiOjE3Nzc0Nzg3MTAsImV4cCI6MTc3OTI5MzExMH0.orNbodFWVQxl-_wmy-8oe8B4OHQ9J6U6Nyhwotc82GQ
@citizenUserId = CITIZEN_USER_ID_HERE

### 1. Créer un signalement (citoyen) - Doit envoyer REPORT_CREATED
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "bacId": "f8e12345-0000-4c1d-9e2f-abc123000010",
  "reportType": "PLEIN",
  "description": "Test signalement citoyen avec notification push",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "locationUser": "Douala, Cameroun"
}

### 2. Vérifier les notifications du citoyen après signalement
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/user/{{citizenUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Mettre à jour le statut du signalement - Doit envoyer REPORT_STATUS_CHANGED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reports/REPORT_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "EN_COURS",
  "comment": "Signalement en cours de traitement"
}

### 4. Assigner un agent - Doit envoyer REPORT_ASSIGNED à l'agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/interventions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reportId": "REPORT_ID_HERE",
  "agentId": "AGENT_ID_HERE"
}

### 5. Marquer comme terminé - Doit envoyer REPORT_COMPLETED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reports/REPORT_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "TERMINE",
  "comment": "Signalement traité avec succès"
}

### 6. Vérifier l'historique complet des notifications du citoyen
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/user/{{citizenUserId}}?unreadOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Compter les notifications non lues du citoyen
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/user/{{citizenUserId}}/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Marquer les notifications comme lues
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mark-all-read
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": "{{citizenUserId}}"
}

### 9. Test direct de notification REPORT_CREATED
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/test
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": "{{citizenUserId}}",
  "event": "REPORT_CREATED",
  "data": {
    "reportId": "test_report_123",
    "referenceCode": "REP-001",
    "reportType": "PLEIN",
    "priority": "HIGH",
    "reporterId": "{{citizenUserId}}"
  }
}

### 10. Lister tous les signalements pour trouver un ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Vérifier si le citoyen a un App ID OneSignal
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/user/{{citizenUserId}}/has-onesignal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
